  "slug": "spt-korean-project-locale-patcher",
  "teaser": "SPT Tarkov Korean Translation Project. Updated and improved missing Korean localization.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2222.png",
  "downloads": 12852,
  "favourites_count": 7,
  "description": "<p><strong>Find all release versions, including a KR-only option, on our GitHub page:</strong>\n<strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/GoLani11/SPT-Korean-Project/releases\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://github.com/GoLani11/SPT-Korean-Project/releases</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Note:</strong> The version on this page supports both English and Korean (EN/KR). If you only need the Korean version, please use the GitHub link above.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Welcome to the SPT-Korean-Project.</strong></p>\n<p>This mod updates and improves the Korean localization for SPT.</p>\n<p><strong>How to Install:</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the <code>SPT_Korean_Localization_G&amp;M.zip</code> file.</li>\n<li>Extract the contents into your main SPT folder. The files should be placed as follows:\n<ul>\n<li><code>SPT/user/mods/spt_korean_localization_G&amp;M</code></li>\n<li><code>SPT/BepInEx/plugins/GoLani.KoreanModFix.dll</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Enjoy it!</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Thanks To:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Makina7</strong> — For collaborating on the localization work.</li>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1974-spt-community-korean-patcher/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Gomeng</a></strong> — For the basic code structure.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Icon Credit:</strong>\n<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://kr.freepik.com/icon/flag_14386928#fromView=search&amp;page=3&amp;position=10&amp;uuid=fc8f3cdf-09b1-490b-bcc4-3d21e68b843f\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://kr.freepik.com/icon/flag_14386928</a></p>\n",
